---
/*
  LOGO COMPONENT — real PYT logo (2026-08-18).

  The logo graphic itself contains BOTH the colored "PYT" mark and the
  "Peninsula Youth Theatre" wordmark stacked underneath — so there is
  no separate HTML text next to it anymore (there used to be; removed
  on purpose to avoid showing the name twice).

  Because it has real text baked into the image, it needs more height
  than the old icon-only placeholder to stay legible — see .logo-mark
  below. If a future version of the logo arrives as a wider/horizontal
  lockup instead of a stacked one, this sizing will need revisiting.

  Every page uses THIS component, so swapping the file here updates
  the logo everywhere at once.
*/
---

<a href="/" class="logo" aria-label="Peninsula Youth Theatre — home">
  <img src="/uploads/pyt-logo-stars.png" alt="Peninsula Youth Theatre" class="logo-mark" width="2526" height="1398" />
</a>

<style>
  .logo {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .logo-mark {
    height: 44px;
    width: auto;
    display: block;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 520px) {
    .logo-mark {
      height: 54px;
    }
  }
</style>
